    "The final analysis reports correctness, route adherence, Operational Tokens, latency, and bounded acquisition diagnostics separately for each repository shape, with censored or partial evidence labelled and no statistical, monetary, or automatic-routing claim.",
    "The WI-0140 artifact subtree remains byte-identical to its accepted closeout revision throughout preparation and execution."
  ],
